In this folder there is the Basic exmaple for REALNVP flows (https://lux.csail.mit.edu/stable/tutorials/intermediate/7_RealNVP) from the Lux Tutorials as a Pluto notebook.
In order to run it, create a Julia Enviorement (tested for 1.11.3.) and install Pluto. Then open the notebook in Pluto, it should take care of the rest.

REQUIREMENTS:
  JULIA
  CUDA
